  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" id="yui_3_17_2_1_1774459861358_16716"><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 lb (450g) 80/20 ground chuck</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">8 oz (225g) hot Italian pork sausage (approx. 2 links, casings removed)</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">200g (1 med-lrg) onion, medium diced</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">20g (4 cloves) garlic, minced or pressed</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Coarse salt, to taste</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1g (1/2 tsp) dried oregano</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1g (1/2 tsp) red chili flake</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">75g (1/3 cup) tomato paste</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">15g (1 Tbsp) Beef Better Than Bouillon</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">28 oz (800g) can crushed tomatoes</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">600g water (or enough to fill the empty tomato can ¾ of the way)</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">7-8g (2 tsp) granulated sugar</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">10g (3 Tbsp) fresh basil, chopped</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">1 lb Dry Spaghetti</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Olive oil (for tossing pasta)</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Parmesan cheese, for garnish</p></li></ul></div>


  
