  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><ol data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Heat about a tablespoon of oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat. Add the ground beef and Italian sausage. Cook, crushing constantly with a meat musher or sturdy spatula, until the meat is fully browned and broken down into pea-sized pieces.</p></li></ol></div>


  
