  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">2. Add the diced onion, minced garlic, and a pinch of salt to the meat. Sweat for 3-5 minutes until the onions are translucent and soft.</p></div>


  
