  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">4. Pour in the crushed tomatoes, sugar, Beef Bouillon, Chile flake, oregano and water. Stir until everything is well incorporated and bring the mixture to a simmer.</p></div>


  
